atorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}^{2}}{2!}-\\frac{{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}^{3}}{3!}+⋯+\\frac{{(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}^{n}}{n!}+⋯=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186632701 :question/problem "Find \n$\\begin{vmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ r & 2s & -4 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -t\\end{vmatrix}$\ngiven that \n$\\begin{vmatrix}2s & -4 \\\\ 5 & -t\\end{vmatrix}=\\frac{5}{3}.$" "Find \n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ r & 2s & -4 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -t\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\ngiven that \n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}2s & -4 \\\\ 5 & -t\\end{vmatrix}=\\frac{5}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186632702 :question/problem "If\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3+t & 4t \\\\ -3 & 3-t\\end{bmatrix}$\nand $det(A)=45,$ what is the value of $t?$\n\n$t=$\n{{field-1}}" "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}3+t & 4t \\\\ -3 & 3-t\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(A)=45,$ what is the value of $t?$\n\n$t=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186632708 :question/problem "Find the sum of the following series. Do not round the answer.\n\n$1-\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{16}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯=$\n{{field-1}}" "Find the sum of the following series. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle 1-\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{16}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186632714 :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{(x+5)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{25}=1.$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm$\n{{field-2}}" "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{(x+5)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{25}=1.\n$$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm$\n{{field-2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186632718 :question/problem "![](images/f2/f297a1bb57a49ea089544635aa209c5fa07926ea9d077b15c92f71ee406511c3.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ bounded by the polar curve $r=2-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta$ for $-\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\le \\theta \\le \\frac{\\pi }{2},$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" "![](images/f2/f297a1bb57a49ea089544635aa209c5fa07926ea9d077b15c92f71ee40